Per RC QP (depth 1024):
   SQ WQE ring                             65,536 B
   send-CQ ring                            65,536 B
   internal buf (ibuf)                    262,400 B
   SQ doorbell record                           8 B
   CQ doorbell record                           8 B
   device QP descriptor (incl. mvars)         184 B
   device CQ descriptor                        72 B
   sum                                    393,744 B =    384.5 KiB
   of which NIC-protocol state excl. ibuf: 131,344 B

